\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Our life is hid with Christ in God;
\par Our Life shall soon appear,
\par And shed His glory all abroad
\par In all His members here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our souls are in His mighty hand,
\par And He shall keep them still;
\par And you and I shall surely stand
\par With Him on Zion's hill.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O what a joyful meeting there!
\par In robes of white arrayed,
\par Palms in our hands we all shall bear,
\par And crowns upon our head.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then let us lawfully contend,
\par And fight our passage through;
\par Bear in our faithful minds the end,
\par And keep the prize in view.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

